{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "label": "ADR 0011: A kanban context is a window, and a window is not a clock", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_kanban_window", "label": "A kanban context is a rolling window", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A board with no sprints gets a window: a bounded, reproducible stretch of calendar days holding the issues open at the as-of date plus those resolved inside it, round-tripping through an id like PROJ/42/win:30d. The board unbounded, a release/epic boundary, a synthetic sprint and a mixed rollup were all rejected."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_not_a_clock", "label": "A window is not a clock", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A sprint is both a bound and a clock; a window supplies only the bound. Expanding its dates into working days would print 'Pace vs clock: -18 pp' for a team that never committed to anything \u2014 arithmetically correct and about nothing. So the window carries no working-day list and pace, scope growth, burndown and sprint health refuse. It is a second caller of contextWorkingDays()'s rollup rule, not a new mechanism."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_membership", "label": "Window membership: open at as-of plus resolved inside", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "This set keeps ageing and WIP (which resolved-only loses) and is reproducible from the schema (which 'anything touched' is not). Cost: Delivered % has no denominator and refuses, because done/total over a set defined partly by being done rises when the window widens."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_flow_health", "label": "Flow health replaces the sprint-health chip", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Flow efficiency 40%, blockers 30%, ageing 30% through the same composition machinery; the chip names which composite it carries and refuses outright without flow efficiency because what survives is hygiene."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_tile_with_no_subject_hidden", "label": "A tile that can never say anything is not shown", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Burndown, commitment history and team load have no subject on a flow board; three permanent apologies become furniture. They are disabled in the tile picker with the reason, and the reader's selection is masked not edited."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_forecaster_fixes", "label": "Two forecaster fixes: dedupe by key, no default target", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "team_slice() gathered three overlapping windows of one board so every issue arrived up to three times and the forecast came back 2.5x too fast; the window's endDate (today) was used as default target so 'will this land' answered 0% against a deadline nobody set. Also: forecast.build() passes 'or 10', inventing a ten-day sprint before recommend_commitment() can refuse \u2014 a live defect."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_kanban_window", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_not_a_clock", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_membership", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_flow_health", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_tile_with_no_subject_hidden", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_forecaster_fixes", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal", "relation": "cites", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0010_an_empty_selection_is_a_refusal_empty_selection_refusal", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_not_a_clock", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_not_a_clock", "target": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_kanban_window", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_window_not_a_clock", "target": "src_app_contextworkingdays", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0011-a-kanban-context-is-a-window-not-a-clock.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0011_a_kanban_context_is_a_window_not_a_clock_kanban_window", "target": "forge_src_jira_parsecontextid", "relation": "referenc